James 1:1 , We are to rejoice under the cross;
James 1:5 , to ask patience of God;
James 1:13 , and in our trials not to impute our weakness, or sins, to him
James 1:19 . but rather to hearken to the word, to meditate on it, and to do thereafter;
James 1:26 , Otherwise men may seem, but never be, truly religious.
